# NeedsYou

Everything waiting on the project's owner, oldest first within a kind. Kinds carry a
two-letter tag so they read without colour: PR (branch awaiting review),
ED (proposed edict), DS (open dissent), BD (board thread with new posts),
GP (pending gameplan proposal). Plugins add kinds with their own tag.

@compact
┌────────────────────────────────┐
│ Needs you                    4 │
├────────────────────────────────┤
│ ▸ PR #38 feat/tui-shell        │
│   ED 0011 Daedalus TUI         │
│   BD kannon: 0009 scope?       │
│   GP T-e5 → done               │
└────────────────────────────────┘
note: shows as many rows as fit; the count is the full total.

